Page 2 — Expected vs Actual Processing Flow

3. Expected PDF Processing Flow

The normal DHD EPIC processing flow is approximately:

EPIC ZIP
   ↓
Download from S3
   ↓
Extract files
   ↓
Identify PDF / HTML / Image documents
   ↓
Transform documents to PDF
   ↓
PDF processing using Aspose
   ↓
Merge PDFs
   ↓
Generate final PDF
   ↓
Upload final PDF
   ↓
EHR / downstream delivery

For a normal PDF, each document should successfully pass through the PDF transformation process before being included in the final merge.

