4. Actual Flow for Case 76696817

The production logs indicate:

EPIC ZIP
   ↓
PDF successfully downloaded
   ↓
PDF copied to temporary location
   ↓
Aspose PDF processing starts
   ↓
Page resize attempted
   ↓
Aspose exception
   ↓
Exception caught
   ↓
"Skipping resize for page..."
   ↓
Processing continues
   ↓
PDF merge/conversion
   ↓
Invalid annotation dictionary error
   ↓
PDF conversion returns null/empty
   ↓
Final PDF generation fails
   ↓
Case remains unprocessed

Key Finding

The message:

Skipping resize for page X

does not necessarily mean the complete PDF was skipped.

It means the application skipped that particular resize operation and continued processing.

This distinction is important because the problematic PDF can continue into the subsequent PDF processing/merge flow.

